            "id": 148333,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa deve includere la funzione <code>.map()</code> per generare correttamente un nuovo array di valori?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\">Un'istruzione return</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sintassi per modificare il valore dell'array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Un'istruzione return.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 148334,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale tipo di funzione possiamo incorporare per semplificare la sintassi della funzione <code>.map()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Una funzione freccia</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Una funzione inline</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Una funzione freccia.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 148335,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Su quale tipo di array funziona <code>.map()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Array di qualsiasi tipo</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Solo array di <code>string</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Array di qualsiasi tipo.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 148336,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiama la funzione <code>.map()</code> sull'array <code>values</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" values = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" doubledLoot = values.map(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" element*element);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(doubledLoot);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>values</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e infine <code>map</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 148337,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi una funzione inline all'interno della funzione <code>.map()</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"94\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyTypes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dragon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lengths = enemyTypes.map(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>function</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #18",
            "id": 148338,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi il parametro appropriato per consentire alla funzione inline di accedere ai valori dell'array.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"86\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pickups = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;coin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;gem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;heart&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lengths = pickups.map(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(element);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>element</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #19",
            "id": 148339,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi i parametri appropriati per dare alla funzione inline accesso ai valori e agli indici dell'array.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"98\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pickups = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;coin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;gem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;heart&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" debugPickups = pickups.map(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element, index\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(element, index);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>element</code>, seguito da <code>index</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #20",
            "id": 148340,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi la parola chiave corretta in modo che la funzione <code>.map()</code> popoli l'array <code>places</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"106\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Archer&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Rogue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" places = players.map(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element, index\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" index+\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;. &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + element;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(places);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>return</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
